'''Imperator Sael''' (ゴマサーマン, ''Goma Sāman'', '''Goma Thurman''') is an [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien]] variant of [[Sir Seal]] that appears in the [[Main Chapters Levels|Main Chapters]] and [[Legend Stages]]. He was added in [[Version 4.0 Update|Version 4.0]].

