==Enemy==
This classy gent has decent health and moderate attack damage, along with Area Attack. Not particularly fast, yet he also outranges [[Bird Cat (Normal Cat)|Bird Cat]] and [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Titan Cat]] and has a chance to slow units.

==Strategy==
To kill him, spam meatshields such as [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Cat]] and [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Wall Cat]] and long ranged attackers like [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)]], [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Sexy Legs Cat]] or [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]], though when [[Imperator Sael]] is at higher magnification such as in [[Into the Future|Into The Future 3]], Units such as [[Psychocat (Rare Cat)|Psychocat]] or [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Seafarer Cat]] are great options to effectively deal with him.

He might be intimidating at the early game but once obtaining [[Into the Future]] Treasures, it should be relatively easy to kill him.

