==Trivia==
*His Japanese name, Goma Thurman, may be a reference to [[wikipedia:Uma Thurman|Uma Thurman]], an American actress and model.
*The planet Otto in his Japanese description may be a shortening of the word ''ottosei'' (オットセイ), meaning "fur seal", but could just as well be referencing a planet of the same name from ''[[wikipedia:UFO Baby|UFO Baby]]''.
*The last line of his Japanese description makes a pun with the phrase "todo no tsumari" (とどのつまり, meaning "to summarize") and the word ''todo'' (トド meaning "sea lion").
*In his attack and knockback animations, Imperator Sael is shown to be the only [[Sir Seal]] variant with a different set of teeth, as Sael is actually a walrus, not a seal.
*His spritesheet contains a few unused sprites for a green slime effect, presumably meant as part of his attack animation. This slime effect also appears in [[Hyppoh]]'s spritesheet.
*Despite coming to fight Earth's Red Seals, he can often be seen working alongside them, like in [[Muddy Trench]] and [[Narrow Docks]].

